    <item>
      <title>最高法院再次阻止共和党支持的密苏里州投票地图</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/us/politics/supreme-court-missouri-congress.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[绘制这张地图是为了让共和党在中期选举中获得优势。目前尚不清楚密苏里州将如何进行。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/us/politics/supreme-court-missouri-congress.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 15:32:19 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>如果共和党赢得中期选举，特朗普将发放 5,000 美元的“特朗普股息”支票</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/us/politics/trump-dividend-5000-dollar-checks.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[总统在大会演讲中提出，如果共和党继续控制国会，将为每个成年美国人提供 5,000 美元的“特朗普红利”。与许多其他想法一样，这个想法可能不会实现。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/us/politics/trump-dividend-5000-dollar-checks.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 15:29:29 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>股票和债券波动导致油价飙升</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/business/oil-middle-east-iran-war.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于投资者担心能源供应减少和通胀加速的前景，原油价格触及数月来最高水平，债券收益率继续上升。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/business/oil-middle-east-iran-war.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 15:13:01 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>伊朗战争将全球煤炭使用量推至历史新高</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/climate/global-coal-demand-iran-war.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[几乎所有世界领导人都同意出于气候原因“逐步减少”煤炭燃烧五年后，这种燃料的使用比以往任何时候都更加广泛。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/climate/global-coal-demand-iran-war.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 15:10:56 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>官员称也门胡塞武装夺取战略红海港口</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/world/middleeast/yemens-houthis-seize-strategic-red-sea-port-officials-say.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[伊朗支持的民兵在莫卡击溃了也门政府军，使该组织在攻击全球贸易关键水道上的船只方面处于更有利的地位。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/world/middleeast/yemens-houthis-seize-strategic-red-sea-port-officials-say.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:56:08 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>共和党中期代表大会的 7 个要点</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/us/politics/trump-republican-convention-speech-takeaways.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在一场史无前例的中期大会上，特朗普总统大多表示了重述和自我祝贺。然后，他提出如果共和党继续掌权，将向美国人每人支付 5,000 美元。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/10/us/politics/trump-republican-convention-speech-takeaways.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:17:54 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
